        "content": "⚠️ DEPRECATED FOR ON-DEMAND (N8N-A02)\n\nAs of the Generate-Then-Review change, on-demand content is generated up-front by N8N-A02 and only HELD for moderation. Admin Approve/Reject is now a pure DB status flip in apps/web/src/app/actions/qa.ts — it NO LONGER calls this workflow and never regenerates media.\n\nThis workflow is retained only for the CALENDAR per-item QA approval path.",
